ow`, `title`, `body`. Unslotted text follows\nthe lockup's tier too: a bare `Heading` takes the title tier and a bare `Text` the body tier."],[744,"**Fallback content**: Provide placeholder content for loading states"],[732,"**Faster Rendering**: Browser optimizations for `<use>` elements"],[717,"**First Request**: When an icon is first encountered, it triggers an asynchronous fetch from the CDN"],[666,"**Flexible sizing**: Support for `width` and `height` props"],[1375,"**Form integration**: Set `name` and the value submits as part of a native `<form>` (multiple values submit as repeated entries)"],[720,"**Full SVG Rendering**: Each icon instance renders as a complete SVG element with all path data"],[1883,"**Group gap**: Minimum 24px between bar groups"],[1895,"**Grouped rendering**: Bars are rendered in SVG `<Group>` elements for logical organization"],[1723,"**Home**"],[1898,"**Horizontal charts**: Vertical scrolling when many categories exceed container height"],[1887,"**Horizontal scrolling**: When data points exceed available width, the chart becomes horizontally scrollable"],[2077,"**HTML Elements:** When using `as=\"button\"`, TypeScript enforces button-specific props like `type`, `disabled`, and `onClick`."],[2068,"**Important**: Since `Flex` and `Grid` extend `Box`, prefer them for layouts. Use `Box` only when you need a non-flex, non-grid container."],[695,"**Important**: When you supply a `className`, you make a commitment to take over all styling of the component as it will remove the standard class names. Use data attributes for targeted styling instead."],[735,"**Initial Flash**: Brief moment where icons appear/disappear during sprite injection"],[1861,"**Interactive tooltips**: Hover to see exact values, with smart positioning and scroll-awareness"],[293,"**isInvalid**: Shows error state styling"],[292,"**isRequired**: Marks the group as required with visual indicator"],[1890,"**Keyboard navigation**: Bar groups are keyboard accessible with `tabInde