hout it, the field follows the surrounding scope. An explicit `size` on a part still wins for that part"],[975,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, input, steppers, description, and error; without it, the field follows the surrounding scope"],[1374,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets the label, trigger, and options, which open at the same size even though they render in a portal. Without it, the Select follows the surrounding scope"],[1721,"**Space / Enter**"],[1214,"**Space**: Select the focused radio button"],[297,"**Space**: Toggles the focused checkbox"],[882,"**Space/Enter**: activate an item; **Escape**: close"],[1339,"**Space/Enter**: Select the focused segment"],[724,"**Sprite Sheet Creation**: A hidden SVG sprite sheet is automatically injected into the DOM containing symbol definitions"],[734,"**SSR Limitation**: Sprite references render empty until client-side hydration"],[1430,"**Standalone** - with no parent context it renders with its own structural defaults and looks the same everywhere."],[974,"**Steppers**: A stepper is a `Group` holding `Button slot=\"decrement\"`, an `Input`, and `Button slot=\"increment\"`. Left empty, each button takes its icon and `variant=\"control\"` from the field, so no icon imports are needed. Compose a bare `Input` instead for a plain numeric input"],[1899,"**Sticky axes**: Positioned absolutely to remain visible during scroll"],[1888,"**Sticky y-axis**: The y-axis remains visible during horizontal scroll"],[674,"**Styling**: `className`, `style`, `data-*` attributes"],[718,"**SVG Parsing**: The fetched SVG string is parsed into a React element using `@bento/svg-parser`"],[1717,"**Tab**"],[296,"**Tab**: Moves focus to the next/previous checkbox"],[1211,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the radio group"],[1337,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the segmented controller"],[1781,"**The body is `<Text slot=\"body\">`**, once or as many times as the c